Clear the level:

Destroy all objects and monsters on the level, except for your nude
self and the "AoY (and any invocation artifacts that you have), and
then ascend.

Use confused create monster to fill the level with acid blobs -
eliminate the riders - smash or stone2flesh the boulders and destroy
them - fill the level again.  Use charm monster to move around the
level without having to create too many more acid blobs, killing all
non-blob monsters, - collect all items, and polymorph a sack
containing them to destroy them.  On your last moves, genocide the
acid blobs and quaff a potion of object detection, then cast 'detect
monsters' and feel lonely, before finally sacrificing the amulet.

You probably don't have enough magic markers and blank scrolls to
manage this.  If you farm the riders, you should be able to create
enough junk to complete this task, though.

